        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tamzin Outhwaite, Joe Penhall, Dennis Kelly, Mark Little, Emily Watson, Kwame Kwei-Armah, Vicky Featherstone, Torben Betts, Lucinda Coxon, Adam Spreadbury-Maher, Brice Stratford\n- Organizations: White Bear Theatre, BBC One\n- Productions: EastEnders, Red Cap, New Tricks\n\nFacts:\n- Tamzin Outhwaite played Melanie Owen in the BBC One soap opera EastEnders from 1998 until 2002.\n- Since gaining national notice from EastEnders, Tamzin Outhwaite has starred in theatre and television productions including Red Cap and New Tricks.\n- The White Bear Theatre has had notable theatre practitioners work there, including Tamzin Outhwaite, Joe Penhall, Dennis Kelly, Mark Little, Emily Watson, Kwame Kwei-Armah, Vicky Featherstone, Torben Betts, Lucinda Coxon, Adam Spreadbury-Maher, and Brice Stratford.",
